{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"www.cima.ned.org/Digital Trust Initiatives Seeking to Reward Journalistic Ethics Online.txt"},"lines":{"text":"- The Trust Project is an international consortium of news organizations promoting standards of transparency and working with technology platforms to affirm and amplify journalism's commitment to transparency, accuracy, inclusion, and fairness so that the public can make informed news choices. It is based on a user-centered design process that relies on Trust Indicators and a collaborative evaluation process of its news media partners. See \"Frequently Asked Questions,\" The Trust Project, n.d.,  accessed July 2023.\n"},"line_number":271,"absolute_offset":59430,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"media partner"},"start":424,"end":437}]}}
